summary:
  The level poll stays at full rate all night in a window that was the last one touched.

history:
  A radio is started and left. Its window keeps the keyboard until
  something else takes it, which on a machine nobody is at is never. The
  keyboard alone is not somebody at the window.

target:
  package/contents/ui/WindowLogic.js

find:
      if (seat === "window") return hovered === true && active === true;

replace:
      if (seat === "window") return active === true;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_windowlogic.qml::test_in_the_window_it_takes_the_pointer_and_the_keyboard.
